sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Manager Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant Z as AuthZ Service
    participant C as LeaderboardController
    participant R as Shared Redis Cluster
    participant MR as Metrics Repository
    participant US as Usage Service

    Note over M,C: Global leaderboard across org scope\nInputs: orgId, metric (score|sessions|tokens|calls), from, to, limit, cursor

    M->>G: GET /orgs/{orgId}/leaderboards/global?metric=&from=&to=&limit=&cursor=
    G->>Z: authorize(subject=manager, action=read_leaderboard, resource=orgId)
    alt authorized
        Z-->>G: allow
        G->>C: Forward request (orgId, metric, from, to, limit, cursor)

        C->>R: GET cache["lb_global", orgId, metric, from, to, limit, cursor]
        alt cache hit
            R-->>C: cached page
            C-->>G: 200 OK + {rows[], nextCursor}
            G-->>M: 200 OK + {rows[], nextCursor}
        else cache miss
            alt metric in [score, sessions]
                C->>MR: getLeaderboard(orgId, metric, from, to, limit, cursor)
                MR-->>C: {rows[], nextCursor}
            else metric in [tokens, calls]
                C->>US: getUsageLeaderboard(orgId, metric, from, to, limit, cursor)
                US-->>C: {rows[], nextCursor}
            end

            Note over C: Break ties by lastActivity desc then userId asc
            C->>R: SET cache["lb_global", orgId, metric, from, to, limit, cursor] = page TTL=5m
            C-->>G: 200 OK + {rows[], nextCursor}
            G-->>M: 200 OK + {rows[], nextCursor}
        end
    else forbidden
        Z-->>G: deny
        G-->>M: 403 Forbidden
    end

    opt cache bust on backfill or re-aggregation
        MR-->>C: leaderboardRebuilt(orgId, metric, from, to)
        C->>R: DEL cache["lb_global", orgId, metric, *]
    end
